<title>PHILIPPINES: Filinvest Q1 net declines slightly.</title>
<headline>Filinvest Q1 net declines slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Revenues (billion)	    1.54 vs 1.78</p>
<p>    Net income		    831.04 vs 910.51</p>
<p>Note: Full name Filinvest Development Corp. The company is engaged in real estate development, banking, and power generation.</p>
